  "createmoderntech.ponder.volumetric_display.header": "Displaying the Surrounding Terrain",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.volumetric_display.text_1": "The Volumetric Display reads the surrounding terrain and projects a hologram",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.volumetric_display.text_2": "The faster the input RPM, the bigger the hologram will be",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.volumetric_display.text_3": "Lenses can be placed on top to magnify or zoom the projection",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.volumetric_display.text_4": "A lens setup can be extended using lens extensions",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.volumetric_display.text_5": "A lens at the top will scale the projection by the strength",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.volumetric_display.text_6": "A lens at the bottom will scale the projection down by the strength",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.volumetric_display.text_7": "Instead of regular shafts, volumetric shafts can be used",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.volumetric_display.text_8": "Controllers can be attached anywhere on the shaft column to manipulate the projection",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.volumetric_display.text_9": "Yaw rotates the projection horizontally",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.volumetric_display.text_10": "Pitch tilts the projection forward and back",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.volumetric_display.text_11": "Pan X shifts the sampled area east or west",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.volumetric_display.text_12": "Pan Z shifts the sampled area east or west",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.volumetric_display.text_13": "Each controller's shaft speed determines how fast the parameter changes"
